  picture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 21da6fb94887fb045a2f16fd3ccc4f4c, type: 3}
  columns: 3
  rows: 3
  title: THE TORN CODEX
  caption: The witches tore the painting of Painal's capture. Put it back together
    to break their spell.
