--- !u!114 &1758104881
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1758104878}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae6d0f49fbfcabe459cb02d659fcf0de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TD_Game.DialogueNPC
  npcName: Yaotl, the pilgrim
  id: yaotl
  firstTalk:
  - I walked here from the world above to bring my brother an offering. I am still
    walking.
  - "To the south-east there is a cave whose walls are all rock. Pilgrims hid their
    treasures there, to pay their way through Mictl\xE1n."
  - North of here stands the black temple, the House of the Wind. Its obsidian gates
    will not open... not without the key.
  - They say the key appears when every servant of the gods has fallen. Count them,
    warrior.
  laterTalk:
  - The cave is to the south-east, the temple to the north. May the road be short.
  body: {fileID: 1360818504}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 1739314709, guid: 1622c75d16ce15649ae8d1e06ce707f8, type: 3}
  sign: {fileID: 1233539291}
  newSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00d8b4e619285ad438ba5699ac7ae674, type: 3}
  talkedSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27e2d5cfaf6daa146a0750d167006ea9, type: 3}
  idleBob: 1
