--- !u!114 &1826517431
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1826517428}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae6d0f49fbfcabe459cb02d659fcf0de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TD_Game.DialogueNPC
  npcName: Tzontli, the bone collector
  id: tzontli
  firstTalk:
  - "Bones, bones, bones... Mictl\xE1n is generous with bones."
  - You want advice? Do not fight the giants with an empty belly. They hit like falling
    mountains. Bring potions.
  - And watch the ground. The ravines of this desert are deep. Some are narrow enough
    to jump; I have seen fast warriors cross them to cut the way.
  - "If you get lost, look for the skull of stone. It looks south, towards the lake
    of X\xF3lotl."
  laterTalk:
  - Narrow ravines can be jumped. Wide ones... well. More bones for me.
  body: {fileID: 999034271}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 1739314709, guid: 1622c75d16ce15649ae8d1e06ce707f8, type: 3}
  sign: {fileID: 1160523397}
  newSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00d8b4e619285ad438ba5699ac7ae674, type: 3}
  talkedSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27e2d5cfaf6daa146a0750d167006ea9, type: 3}
  idleBob: 1
